title: Autumn Leaves
key: Gm
tempo: 132
style: jazz

// Thirty-two bars, AABC. Two-five-ones round the relative major and then
// round the minor key: every chord falls a fifth to the next. C, the last
// eight, goes round the minor key twice as fast on its way home.
[A]
| Cm7   | F7   | Bbmaj7 | Ebmaj7 |
| Am7b5 | D7b9 | Gm6    | %      |

